  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sophrology - Help blood cancer patients</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cancer treatment is very intense : numerous hospitalitions, painful body, psychological isolation &amp; distress, side effects (skin alteration, hair and eyebrow loss, weight...). For several years, we offers weekly therapeutic support workshop of sophrology. They are aimed at evacuating tensions, recovering one&apos;s tonus, positivizing, taking care of oneself, and transmitting techniques to practice these exercises on a daily basis.</narrative>
  </description>
